{"type":"message","id":"3e4b7339","parentId":"5c05abb6","timestamp":"2026-02-03T17:09:23.755Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-02-03 17:09 UTC] BLUEPRINT A/B TEST — BETA (Document-First)\n\nYou are running Test Beta for the Bellevue Standpipe project. Your approach: Extract everything first, build full index, then analyze.\n\nPROJECT: NYC H+H Fire Pump and Standpipe Replacement - Bellevue Hospital\nPROJECT PATH: /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/projects/bellevue-standpipe/\n\nSTATUS FILE: Update /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/projects/bellevue-standpipe/test-status.json as you progress (update tests.beta section).\n\nDOCUMENTS in \"Bellevue - Standpipe/\" subfolder:\n- 8 Drawing PDFs (Parts 1-8)\n- 3 Specification PDFs (Parts 1-3)\n- Abatement Spec\n- IFB Part 1 (front-end)\n- Section A-B Revised\n\nPHASE 1: Extract All PDFs\n- Use pdftotext to extract text from all spec PDFs\n- Use pdfinfo to get page counts\n- List what's in each PDF (table of contents, sheet index)\n- Save extraction to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/projects/bellevue-standpipe/extracted/\n\nPHASE 2: Build Full Index\n- Create a master index of all sheets/sections\n- Identify which sheets are Fire Protection (FP-xxx)\n- Identify spec sections by division\n- Map sheets to rooms/areas\n\nPHASE 3: All Experts Parallel\n- For this test, focus on Fire Protection expert analysis\n- Read expert file: /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/experts/fire-protection/EXPERT.md\n- Analyze all FP-related content\n\nPHASE 4: Critic Synthesis\n- Review all findings\n- Cross-check for conflicts\n- Identify coordination issues\n\nPHASE 5: Map to Bid Items\n- Match findings to bid-breakdown-mapped.json items\n- Note any scope not in bid breakdown\n- Note any bid items not found in docs\n\nOUTPUT: Write findings to /home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/projects/bellevue-standpipe/test-beta-results.json\n\nUpdate status file at each phase. Report back when complete with summary of findings and metrics (time, items processed, issues found)."}],"timestamp":1770138563754}}
