ct Documents are as defined in the “Agreement”. The General Conditions shall\napply to all Work of this Section.\n\nB.\n\nWork specified herein shall be the removal and disposal of Asbestos-Containing Materials\n(ACM) and Presumed Asbestos-Containing Materials (PACM) from designated areas of\nthe Cellar and Penthouse, located at Bellevue Hospital, 462 1st Avenue, New York, NY\n11375.\n\nC.\n\nThe following documents were reviewed and utilized to generate this abatement design\nspecification which serves to locate and quantify the amount of PACM, to be abated in\nsupport of this project.\n1.\n2.\n\nD.\n\n1.02\n\nScope of Work and Background drawings prepared/emailed by Loring Consulting\nEngineers for Main Hospital H dated 05/16/2023\nAsbestos Survey Report performed by ATC Group Services titled Fire Pump &\nStandpipe Replacement Project – Bellevue Hospital, dated August 4, 2023.\n\nThe phasing and scheduling of work for this project shall be coordinated with and\napproved by the Construction Project Manager and Facility Manager. The Construction\nProject Manager and Facility Manager will make the final determination on all issues"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":231,"aggregated":"PROJECT NAME\n\nBELLEVUE HOSPITAL\nCENTER\nBUILDING \"H\"\nFIRE PUMP AND STANDPIPE REMOVAL\nPROJECT\n462 1ST AVE, NEW YORK, NY 10016\nCLIENT PROJECT No.\n\n26-2112-000\n\nKEY PLAN:\nAMBULATORY\nCARE (B)\n\nI&K\n(CELLAR)\n\nEMERGENCY\nDEPT. (F&G)\n\n1ST AVE\n\n28TH ST\n\nMAIN\nHOSPITAL\n(H)\nADMINISTRATION (A)\nC&D BLDG.\n26TH ST\n\nTRUE\nNORTH\n\n-\n\n04/12/2024\n\n100% CONSTRUCTION DOCUMENTS\n\n-\n\n11/03/2023\n\n100% CONSTRUCTION DOCUMENTS\n\n-\n\n08/21/2023\n\n100% CONSTRUCTION DOCUMENTS\n\n-\n\n07/07/2023\n\nCONSTRUCTION DOCUMENTS\n\n-\n\n05/16/2023\n\nDD SUBMISSION\n\n-\n\n04/18/2023\n\nPROGRESS SET ISSUED FOR COORDINATION\n\n-\n\n03/31/2023\n\nPROGRESS SET ISSUED FOR COORDINATION\n\nREV.#\n\nDATE\n\nISSUE DESCRIPTION\n\nARCHITECTURE + INTERIOR DESIGN + CONS