{"type":"message","id":"24c6aea1","parentId":"e2b2ab8e","timestamp":"2026-02-03T17:10:37.632Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now have great data:\n\n1. Full drawing sheet index showing:\n   - FP-001 to FP-003: Notes, symbols, schedules, phasing\n   - FP-101 to FP-128: Removal work plans (Cellar through Penthouse)\n   - FP-201 to FP-228: New work plans (Cellar through Penthouse)\n   - FP-301: Fire Protection Pump Room Part Plan and Schematics\n   - FP-401, FP-402: Riser Diagram Removals\n   - FP-501, FP-502: Riser Diagrams\n   - FP-601 to FP-603: Details\n\n2. Full spec for Standpipes (21 12 00)\n3. Fire Pumps spec (21 30 00)\n\nKey findings from drawing index:\n- 6 ALTERNATES for standpipe work:\n  - Alt 1: Standpipe 1 - North Stair\n  - Alt 2: Standpipe 2 - Northeast side\n  - Alt 3: Standpipe 3 - East Stair\n  - Alt 4: Standpipe 4 - Southeast side\n  - Alt 5: (partial text - another standpipe area)\n  - Alt 6: (partial text - another building area)\n\nThis is a 23-story hospital building (Cellar through 22nd floor plus Penthouse/Roof).\n\nNow let me:\n1. Read the Fire Protection expert file\n2. Read the bid breakdown3. Build a comprehensive index\n4. Analyze and identify coordination issues","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Excellent data! Found 60+ FP sheets covering removal and new work across 23 floors. Now reading expert file and bid breakdown:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_018Bct5E4sucAXjhUU9V1TDm","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/experts/fire-protection/EXPERT.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01BF8fs53DpK8BstpTeNGou1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/projects/bellevue-standpipe/bid-breakdown-mapped.json"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":8,"output":565,"cacheRead":40388,"cacheWrite":16642,"totalTokens":57603,"cost":{"input":0.00004,"output":0.014125,"